        "tree_id": "966f59730b32e5ce611cc8c33c50e6d79d9f5a0b",
        "message": "fix(P0-007): make the dashboard report sources, not memories\n\nThe builder hardcoded gdd.modules = 0, 'GDD-001 not started', HIGH_CONCEPT v1.2\nand 'tracer green', and it looked for metric keys that no longer exist, so a\n12-entry ledger displayed as NOT COMPUTABLE. It counted locks on main, where the\nregistry never has active entries, instead of on state/locks.\n\nEvery displayed value now comes from a named source: metrics.json, HIGH_CONCEPT.md,\na passing tracer evidence log, or origin/state/locks. Unmeasured stays\nNOT COMPUTABLE with its reason. Tier and NET-GATE views are added from metrics.\n\napps/dashboard/check.mjs is a regression guard: two byte-identical rebuilds,\nfield-by-field source comparison, and five forbidden stale literals. Injecting\nmodules: 0 makes it exit 1; the negative log is in the evidence.\n\nAcceptance: build 0, check 0, negative check 1, verify 17/17.\n\nAgent: tools-engineer\nTask: P0-007",
        "timestamp": "2026-11-18T08:40:59Z",
        "author": {
          "name": "strata-tools-engineer",
          "email": "tools@strata.local"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "strata-tools-engineer",
          "email": "tools@strata.local"
        }
